{"type":"message","id":"cab96391","parentId":"e193c591","timestamp":"2026-04-05T00:09:26.574Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"用户在问 memory 内容是否包含在备份包中。让我先检查一下备份脚本和相关配置，看看备份范围是什么。\n\n根据 MEMORY.md 中的信息：\n- 备份脚本：`~/.openclaw/workspace/scripts/openclaw-backup.sh`\n- 备份范围：`.backup/openclaw/`（配置）+ `.backup/skills/`（Skills）\n\n但 memory 文件在 workspace 下，让我确认一下备份脚本的内容。","thinkingSignature":"a9b866ac89cea73f5d98c339267139878ae19fd9363c72550aaa65a71452c344"},{"type":"text","text":"让我查看一下备份脚本的内容：\n"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_function_rw313pq32ng9_1","name":"read","arguments":{"file":"~/.openclaw/workspace/scripts/openclaw-backup.sh"}}],"api":"anthropic-messages","provider":"minimax","model":"MiniMax-M2.7","usage":{"input":130,"output":125,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":39556,"totalTokens":39811,"cost":{"input":0.000039,"output":0.00015,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0.014833500000000001,"total":0.015022500000000001}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1775347761179,"responseId":"0620db314e9e42a4c7c806b647d52144"}}
{"type":"message","id":"ecc7f841","parentId":"cab96391","timestamp":"2026-04-05T00:09:26.609Z","message":{"role":"toolResult","toolCallId":"call_function_rw313pq32ng9_1","toolName":"read","content":[{"type":"text","text":"#!/bin/bash\n# openclaw-backup.sh - 每天备份 OpenClaw 关键配置文件\n# 使用方法: 加入 crontab: 0 3 * * * /Users/edy/.openclaw/workspace/scripts/openclaw-backup.sh\n\nWORKSPACE=\"$HOME/.openclaw/workspace\"\nBACKUP_DIR=\"$WORKSPACE/.backup\"\nOPENCLAW_DIR=\"$HOME/.openclaw\"\nLOG_FILE=\"$WORKSPACE/.backup.log\"\nSTATUS=\"✅ 备份成功\"\nDATE=$(date +%Y-%m-%d)\n\necho \"📦 开始备份... $DATE\"\n\n# 清理旧备份\nrm -rf \"$BACKUP_DIR\"\nmkdir -p \"$BACKUP_DIR\"\n\n# ===== OpenClaw 配置文件（不含 node_modules） =====\necho \"📁 备份 OpenClaw 配置...\"\nmkdir -p \"$BACKUP_DIR/openclaw\"\ncp \"$OPENCLAW_DIR/openclaw.json\" \"$BACKUP_DIR/openclaw/\"\ncp \"$OPENCLAW_DIR/exec-approvals.json\" \"$BACKUP_DIR/openclaw/\" 2>/dev/null\ncp \"$OPENCLAW_DIR/wechat-access-auth.json\" \"$BACKUP_DIR/openclaw/\" 2>/dev/null\n\n# 备份关键目录（排除 node_modules）\nfor dir in identity credentials agents subagents; do\n  if [ -d \"$OPENCLAW_DIR/$dir\" ]; then\n    mkdir -p \"$BACKUP_DIR/openclaw/$dir\"\n    cp -r \"$OPENCLAW_DIR/$dir\"/* \"$BACKUP_DIR/openclaw/$dir/\" 2>/dev/null\n  fi\ndone\n\n# ===== Skills（用户创建的） =====\necho \"📁 备份 Skills...\"\nmkdir -p \"$BACKUP_DIR/skills\"\ncp -r \"$WORKSPACE/skills\" \"$BACKUP_DIR/skills/\" 2>/dev/null\ncp \"$WORKSPACE\"/*.skill \"$BACKUP_DIR/skills/\" 2>/dev/null\n\n# ===== memory 文件（对话记录、每日分析） =====\necho \"📁 备份 memory...\"\nmkdir -p \"$BACKUP_DIR/memory\"\ncp -r \"$WORKSPACE/memory\" \"$BACKUP_DIR/memory/\" 2>/dev/null\n\n# ===== 打包成 tar.gz =====\ncd \"$BACKUP_DIR\"\necho \"📦 打包...\"\nBACKUP_TAR=\"$WORKSPACE/openclaw_backup_${DATE}.tar.gz\"\ntar -czf \"$BACKUP_TAR\" openclaw skills memory 2>/dev/null\nTAR_SIZE=$(du -h \"$BACKUP_TAR\" | cut -f1)\necho \"📦 打包完成: $TAR_SIZE\"\n\n# ===== Git 操作 =====\ncd \"$WORKSPACE\"\necho \"📝 提交变更...\"\n\n# 提交打包文件 + .gitignore + 脚本\ngit add \"openclaw_backup_${DATE}.tar.gz\" .gitignore scripts/ -f\n\n# 单独提交 memory 增量，方便查看变化\ngit add \"memory/\" -f\ngit commit -m \"backup: $DATE\" --quiet 2>/dev/null\n\n# 推送\necho \"🚀 推送到 GitHub...\"\nPUSH_RESULT=$(git push origin main 2>&1)\nPUSH_EXIT=$?\n\nif [ $PUSH_EXIT -ne 0 ]; then\n    STATUS=\"❌ 备份失败\"\n    echo \"$STATUS: $PUSH_RESULT\" | tee -a \"$LOG_FILE\"\n    exit 1\nfi\n\necho \"✅ 备份完成: $(date)\" | tee -a \"$LOG_FILE\"\n\n# ===== 发送飞书通知 =====\npython3 << 'PYEOF'\nimport subprocess, json, sys, os, datetime\n\nAPP_ID = \"cli_a93534f5edb85bd3\"\nCONFIG_FILE = os.path.expanduser(\"~/.openclaw/openclaw.json\")\nwith open(CONFIG_FILE) as f:\n    feishu_cfg = json.load(f).get(\"channels\", {}).get(\"feishu\", {})\nAPP_SECRET = feishu_cfg.get(\"appSecret\", \"\")\nUSER_OPEN_ID = \"ou_2ad19bb3863e71e2d0eff5cc4aeedd83\"\n\nresult = subprocess.run(\n    [\"curl\", \"-s\", \"-X\", \"POST\",\n     \"https://open.feishu.cn/open-apis/auth/v3/tenant_access_token/internal\",\n     \"-H\", \"Content-Type: application/json\",\n     \"-d\", json.dumps({\"app_id\": APP_ID, \"app_secret\": APP_SECRET})],\n    capture_output=True, text=True\n)\ntoken_data = json.loads(result.stdout)\napp_token = token_data.get(\"tenant_access_token\", \"\")\n\nif not app_token:\n    print(\"获取 token 失败，跳过通知\")\n    sys.exit(0)\n\nnow_str = datetime.datetime.now().strftime(\"%Y-%m-%d %H:%M\")\ndate_str = now_str[:10]\nmsg = f\"📦 定时备份报告\\n\\n✅ GitHub 推送成功\\n⏰ 时间：{now_str}\\n📦 备份包：openclaw_backup_{date_str}.tar.gz\\n📁 memory/ 单独 commit，可查看每日变化\"\n\nsubprocess.run(\n    [\"curl\", \"-s\", \"-X\", \"POST\",\n     \"https://open.feishu.cn/open-apis/im/v1/messages?receive_id_type=open_id\",\n     \"-H\", f\"Authorization: Bearer {app_token}\",\n     \"-H\", \"Content-Type: application/json\",\n     \"-d\", json.dumps({\n         \"receive_id\": USER_OPEN_ID,\n         \"msg_type\": \"text\",\n         \"content\": json.dumps({\"text\": msg})\n     })],\n    capture_output=True\n)\nprint(\"飞书通知已发送\")\nPYEOF\n"}],"isError":false,"timestamp":1775347766602}}
{"type":"message","id":"af9a2af2","parentId":"ecc7f841","timestamp":"2026-04-05T00:09:34.676Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"备份脚本清楚显示：\n\n1. **备份范围包括 memory 文件**：\n```bash\n# ===== memory 文件（对话记录、每日分析） =====\necho \"📁 备份 memory...\"\nmkdir -p \"$BACKUP_DIR/memory\"\ncp -r \"$WORKSPACE/memory\" \"$BACKUP_DIR/memory/\" 2>/dev/null\n```\n\n2. **memory 单独做了 git commit**：\n```bash\n# 单独提交 memory 增量，方便查看变化\ngit add \"memory/\" -f\ngit commit -m \"backup: $DATE\" --quiet 2>/dev/null\n```\n\n所以 memory 内容是包含在备份包中的，而且 memory 还单独做了 commit，方便查看每日变化。","thinkingSignature":"0fcae3df0163a0c54c031175cd9c72680f17e85663b8056d88389395d93193d6"},{"type":"text","text":"**有的！** backup 脚本里明确包含了 memory 备份：\n\n```bash\n# ===== memory 文件（对话记录、每日分析） =====\necho \"📁 备份 memory...\"\nmkdir -p \"$BACKUP_DIR/memory\"\ncp -r \"$WORKSPACE/memory\" \"$BACKUP_DIR/memory/\" 2>/dev/null\n```\n\n而且 memory 还有**单独 commit**，方便查看每日变化：\n\n```bash\n# 单独提交 memory 增量，方便查看变化\ngit add \"memory/\" -f\ngit commit -m \"backup: $DATE\" --quiet 2>/dev/null\n```\n\n**备份内容：**\n| 目录 | 说明 |\n|------|------|\n| `.backup/openclaw/` | OpenClaw 配置（openclaw.json、credentials、agents 等） |\n| `.backup/skills/` | 用户创建的 Skills（`~/.openclaw/workspace/skills/`） |\n| `.backup/memory/` | memory 文件夹（每日对话记录、分析等） |\n\n所以你的 memory 内容是完整备份的 ☺️"}],"api":"anthropic-messages","provider":"minimax","model":"MiniMax-M2.7","usage":{"input":1717,"output":360,"cacheRead":39291,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":41368,"cost":{"input":0.0005151,"output":0.000432,"cacheRead":0.0023574599999999996,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0.00330456}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1775347766609,"responseId":"0620db368bfb3e3075085a0e7efcdda9"}}
