{"type":"message","id":"9713fc44","parentId":"91d01b42","timestamp":"2026-04-05T06:30:12.841Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"The subagent found that the GETNOTE_API_KEY is not configured in the environment. This is interesting - the first search worked because the API key was available in the main session, but the subagent spawned doesn't have access to those environment variables.\n\nI should let the user know about this issue. The first search of 8 notes worked, but the expanded search couldn't be done because the API key isn't passed to subagents.\n\nLet me check if there's a way to configure this, or if the user needs to set up the API key for subagents to use.","thinkingSignature":"5c62c2b900af7a1cbf12e8c9e28684c86a7866b677b4d41db2d7a9e4062454db"},{"type":"text","text":"哦有个问题——子agent环境里没有Get笔记的API Key，所以扩展搜索失败了 😅\n\n第一轮能搜是因为我主session里有API配置，但子agent是独立环境，继承不到。\n\n**解决方案：**\n\n需要先配置一下，让子agent也能用Get笔记。有两个选择：\n\n1. **在主session里直接搜**（我来做，不开子agent）\n2. **配置环境变量传递** — 在 `~/.openclaw/workspace/.env` 文件里加入：\n   ```\n   GETNOTE_API_KEY=gk_live_xxx\n   GETNOTE_CLIENT_ID=cli_xxx\n   ```\n\n你想怎么弄？要我直接在主session里多轮搜索吗？"}],"api":"anthropic-messages","provider":"minimax","model":"MiniMax-M2.7","usage":{"input":130,"output":258,"cacheRead":42270,"cacheWrite":2289,"totalTokens":44947,"cost":{"input":0.000039,"output":0.0003096,"cacheRead":0.0025361999999999997,"cacheWrite":0.000858375,"total":0.0037431749999999996}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1775370602172,"responseId":"0621346acae07e8ac555ad3820d0ea7e"}}
