{"type":"message","id":"1ec424a3","parentId":"efb0ffe6","timestamp":"2026-04-05T06:31:49.658Z","message":{"role":"toolResult","toolCallId":"call_function_5fedey3vsd18_2","toolName":"exec","content":[{"type":"text","text":"# TOOLS.md - Local Notes\n\nSkills define _how_ tools work. This file is for _your_ specifics — the stuff that's unique to your setup.\n\n## What Goes Here\n\n--\nSkills are shared. Your setup is yours. Keeping them apart means you can update skills without losing your notes, and share skills without leaking your infrastructure.\n\n---\n\nAdd whatever helps you do your job. This is your cheat sheet."}],"details":{"status":"completed","exitCode":0,"durationMs":19,"aggregated":"# TOOLS.md - Local Notes\n\nSkills define _how_ tools work. This file is for _your_ specifics — the stuff that's unique to your setup.\n\n## What Goes Here\n\n--\nSkills are shared. Your setup is yours. Keeping them apart means you can update skills without losing your notes, and share skills without leaking your infrastructure.\n\n---\n\nAdd whatever helps you do your job. This is your cheat sheet.","cwd":"/Users/edy/.openclaw/workspace"},"isError":false,"timestamp":1775370709651}}
{"type":"message","id":"5f6e7540","parentId":"1ec424a3","timestamp":"2026-04-05T06:31:54.760Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"第一个命令还在运行。让我等一下再poll。同时TOOLS.md里没有Get笔记相关的配置。\n\n让我检查一下进程状态，或者看看是否有其他配置文件记录了API Key。\n\n实际上，之前子agent能做第一轮搜索，说明主session确实能访问Get笔记。可能的方式：\n1. 通过飞书渠道的OAuth\n2. 通过某个配置文件\n3. 通过环境变量传递\n\n让我直接检查一下环境变量中是否有getnote相关的东西。","thinkingSignature":"5e8e561d4ac621e4fb991a8b3c85007ef3ac9ecdce22487f1c05e072b3310430"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_function_qc1sqbkn4o0k_1","name":"process","arguments":{"action":"poll","sessionId":"amber-ocean","timeout":5000}}],"api":"anthropic-messages","provider":"minimax","model":"MiniMax-M2.7","usage":{"input":9147,"output":140,"cacheRead":39291,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":48578,"cost":{"input":0.0027440999999999998,"output":0.000168,"cacheRead":0.0023574599999999996,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0.0052695599999999995}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1775370709659,"responseId":"062134d6951401a68e51014e6b78f46d"}}
