{"type":"message","id":"671f0dcb","parentId":"6ee1451e","timestamp":"2026-04-05T06:32:07.340Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"openclaw.json里没有Get笔记的配置。让我看看Get笔记的skill的_meta.json或者package.json，看看有没有配置信息。或者可能Get笔记的授权是通过飞书渠道做的？\n\n让我想想……之前子agent能搜8条，可能是因为它通过父session继承了某种能力？但API Key是环境变量长度为0。\n\n等等，让我再检查一下MEMORY.md里的Get笔记使用经验，看看是不是通过某种方式配置的：\n\n从MEMORY.md：\n\"### Get笔记 API 使用经验（2026-04-04）\n**API 列表查询（list）**：\n- 不支持日期过滤，只能按时间倒序翻页\n- 7331 条笔记翻到 90 天前约需 2 分钟（36 页 × 0.2s 间隔）\n- 翻列表时用 `exec background:true` + `process poll`，不要阻塞主对话\n\n\n- 语义搜索用 `POST /open/api/v1/resource/recall`，比翻列表快得多，top_k参数最大支持10\n\n看来我之前用过这个API，但具体怎么配置的需要查一下skill的oauth.md文件，或者看看有没有专门存储API密钥的地方。\n\n让我试试直接调用Get笔记的recall API，看看环境中是否已经有凭证了。","thinkingSignature":"1971309506ef9141c103e3aeaf18f504f348e8a30cad77a95a1eba071e786b34"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_function_mb2awulrviul_1","name":"exec","arguments":{"command":"curl -s -X POST \"https://openapi.biji.com/open/api/v1/resource/recall\" \\\n  -H \"Content-Type: application/json\" \\\n  -H \"Authorization: $GETNOTE_API_KEY\" \\\n  -H \"X-Client-ID: $GETNOTE_CLIENT_ID\" \\\n  -d '{\"query\":\"兮兮\",\"top_k\":3}' 2>&1 | head -50"}}],"api":"anthropic-messages","provider":"minimax","model":"MiniMax-M2.7","usage":{"input":10060,"output":359,"cacheRead":39291,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":49710,"cost":{"input":0.003018,"output":0.00043079999999999995,"cacheRead":0.0023574599999999996,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0.005806259999999999}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1775370718834,"responseId":"062134df9880f6bc067bf15cb43bf1d7"}}
