{"type":"message","id":"772d9220","parentId":"724e9e39","timestamp":"2026-04-05T06:35:27.837Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"Great! The authorization was successful. I got the API key. Now let me:\n1. Write the config to openclaw.json\n2. Start searching\n\nLet me first save the config, then do the multi-keyword search.","thinkingSignature":"f9358e458c8ff5f63764a53aecf64ad0ec0578976dcea5a02b9fe10c60ed0b2d"},{"type":"text","text":"授权成功！现在把配置存下来，然后开始多轮搜索 📚\n"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_function_c6237qwnwqd2_1","name":"exec","arguments":{"command":"cat ~/.openclaw/openclaw.json | python3 -c \"\nimport sys, json\n\nwith open('/Users/edy/.openclaw/openclaw.json') as f:\n    d = json.load(f)\n\nif 'skills' not in d:\n    d['skills'] = {}\nif 'entries' not in d['skills']:\n    d['skills']['entries'] = {}\n\nd['skills']['entries']['getnote'] = {\n    'apiKey': 'gk_live_79414cc5d34021a6.f48b009c9ed9470d05fbec8f4ef919f4d657e7a15d91347a',\n    'env': {\n        'GETNOTE_CLIENT_ID': 'cli_a1b2c3d4e5f6789012345678abcdef90'\n    }\n}\n\nwith open('/Users/edy/.openclaw/openclaw.json', 'w') as f:\n    json.dump(d, f, indent=2, ensure_ascii=False)\n\nprint('配置已写入')\n\""}}],"api":"anthropic-messages","provider":"minimax","model":"MiniMax-M2.7","usage":{"input":12462,"output":300,"cacheRead":39291,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":52053,"cost":{"input":0.0037386,"output":0.00035999999999999997,"cacheRead":0.0023574599999999996,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0.00645606}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1775370922322,"responseId":"062135aa3282d9a4d8b612452c8d897c"}}
