{"type":"message","id":"b345dd33","parentId":"4f6459d0","timestamp":"2026-04-05T06:44:07.904Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"Done. Let me confirm to the user.","thinkingSignature":"9e81468c8087ca249453bf87e7b5b622da29bec11d327b1d5b12403d97a29d3a"},{"type":"text","text":"已补充！新增了 **6条吴军教育直播的insights**：\n\n**新增内容：**\n\n| # | 核心观点 | 对辅导的启示 |\n|---|---------|------------|\n| 51 | 刷题教育抹杀灵性和创造力 | 刷题要带脑子，理解本质 |\n| 52 | 教育规划要留有余地，80/20分配 | 给孩子留20%探索空间 |\n| 53 | AI时代需要灵性、创造力和判断力 | 学会与AI协作 |\n| 54 | 文史哲是底座，经济学是进阶 | 人文素养同样重要 |\n| 55 | 下一代必然超越上一代的天花板 | 不以父母认知限制孩子 |\n| 56 | 看到事物的本质 | 追问\"为什么\"而不是\"怎么做\" |\n\n完整文件已更新到 `memory/2026-04-05-getnote-education-insights.md` ✅"}],"api":"anthropic-messages","provider":"minimax","model":"MiniMax-M2.7","usage":{"input":66342,"output":204,"cacheRead":39291,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":105837,"cost":{"input":0.0199026,"output":0.0002448,"cacheRead":0.0023574599999999996,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0.022504859999999998}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1775371441402,"responseId":"062137b184bf4cb952760d1df5e3f1c7"}}
