itle>openapi.biji.com | 404: Not Found</title>\n</head>\n\n<body>\n<div class=\"layout\">\n    <div class=\"header\">\n        <h1>\n            <span>Error</span>\n            <span>404</span>\n            <small class=\"heading-ray-id\">Trace ID: f2bcae463653002 • 2026-04-05 15:08:25</small>\n        </h1>\n        <h2 class=\"subheadline\">Not Found</h2>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"content\">\n        \n        <img src=\"https://piccdn2.umiwi.com/agw/not-found.png\" alt=\"not-found.png\">\n        \n        <p>路由未注册，请联系管理员</p>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"footer\">\n        <span class=\"footer-item\">Igetget TID: <strong>f2bcae463653002</strong></span>\n        <span class=\"footer-separator\">•</span>\n        <span class=\"footer-item\">Your IP: 182.138.223.57</span>\n        <span class=\"footer-separator\">•</span>\n        <span class=\"footer-item\">\n            Performance & security by\n            <a href=\"https://www.igetget.com\" target=\"_blank\">igetget</a>.\n        </span>\n    </div>\n</div>\n</body>\n</html>","cwd":"/Users/edy/.openclaw/workspace"},"isError":false,"timestamp":1775372905843}}
{"type":"message","id":"72869939","parentId":"70a226b4","timestamp":"2026-04-05T07:08:29.555Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"The API endpoint is wrong. Let me check the correct endpoint for knowledge list. From the skill file, the reference was `references/knowledge.md`. Let me read that.","thinkingSignature":"871fbd8d33a674cef661ee6f5fcfcd4724b48f8cfa471e9d3435938c294e331d"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_function_wx09yfkh2rjz_1","name":"read","arguments":{"path":"/Users/edy/.openclaw/workspace/skills/getnote/references/knowledge.md"}}],"api":"anthropic-messages","provider":"minimax","model":"MiniMax-M2.7","usage":{"input":75152,"output":78,"cacheRead":39291,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":114521,"cost":{"input":0.0225456,"output":0.0000936,"cacheRead":0.0023574599999999996,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0.024996659999999997}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1775372905857,"responseId":"06213d6a2e3fa4c849a9acc0c5dbf8e3"}}
{"type":"message","id":"3f929602","parentId":"72869939","timestamp":"2026-04-05T07:08:29.603Z","message":{"role":"toolResult","toolCallId":"call_function_wx09yfkh2rjz_1","toolName":"read","content":[{"type":"text","text":"# 知识库管理\n\n## 概述\n\n知识库的 CRUD 操作，以及知识库内笔记管理、博主订阅内容、直播订阅内容的查询。\n\n---\n\n## 我的知识库列表\n\n```\nGET https://openapi.biji.com/open/api/v1/resource/knowledge/list?page=1\n```\n\n参数：\n- `page`: 页码，从 1 开始，默认 1（固定每页 20 条）\n\n返回：`topics[]`、`has_more`、`total`\n\n每个 topic 包含：\n- `topic_id`：知识库 ID（字符串，后续所有操作接口的 `topic_id` 参数均传此值）\n- `name`、`description`、`cover`\n- `created_at` / `updated_at`：时间字符串（YYYY-MM-DD HH:MM:SS）\n- `stats`：统计数据\n  - `note_count`：笔记数\n  - `file_count`：文件数\n  - `blogger_count`：订阅博主数\n  - `live_count`：已完成直播数\n\n---\n\n## 订阅知识库列表\n\n获取当前用户订阅（但非自己创建）的知识库列表。\n\n**CLI 命令（推荐）**：\n```bash\ngetnote kbs-sub\ngetnote kbs-sub --page 2\ngetnote kbs-sub -o json\n```\n\n返回字段与 `getnote kbs` 相同：`topic_id`、`name`、`description`、`created_at`。\n\n**直接调 API**：\n```\nGET https://openapi.biji.com/open/api/v1/resource/knowledge/subscribe/list?page=1\n```\n\n参数：\n- `page`: 页码，从 1 开始，默认 1（固定每页 20 条）\n\n返回字段与\"我的知识库列表\"相同：`topics[]`、`has_more`、`total`\n\n> 与 `/knowledge/list` 的区别：该接口只返回他人分享/公开的知识库，不包含自己创建的。\n\n**订阅知识库的限制**：\n- ⚠️ **无法添加笔记**：订阅的知识库只读，不能向其中添加笔记\n- ⚠️ **查看源内容受限**：若知识库管理员关闭了「查看源文件」，则无法获取笔记原文，只能对该知识库进行语义搜索（`/recall/knowledge`）\n\n---\n\n## 创建知识库\n\n```\nPOST https://openapi.biji.com/open/api/v1/resource/knowledge/create\nContent-Type: application/json\n```\n\n请求体：\n```json\n{\n  \"name\": \"知识库名称\",\n  \"description\": \"描述\",\n  \"cover\": \"\"\n}\n```\n\n⚠️ 每天最多创建 50 个知识库（北京时间 00:00 重置）。\n\n---\n\n## 知识库笔记列表\n\n```\nGET https://openapi.biji.com/open/api/v1/resource/knowledge/notes?topic_id=abc123&page=1\n```\n\n参数：\n- `topic_id` (string, 必填) - 知识库 ID（来自 `/knowledge/list` 的 `topic_id` 字段）\n- `page`: 页码，从 1 开始，默认 1（固定每页 20 条）\n\n返回 `notes[]`，每项字段：\n- `note_id`：笔记 ID（**字符串**）\n- `title`、`content`、`note_type`、`tags`、`created_at`、`edit_time`\n\n用 `has_more` 判断是否有下一页。\n\n---\n\n## 知识库选择逻辑\n\n当用户说「存到对应的知识库」或「存到相关知识库」时：\n1. 先调用 `GET /knowledge/list` 获取所有知识库列表\n2. 根据笔记标题、内容、标签，与知识库名称和描述做模糊匹配\n3. 匹配置信度高时直接执行，并告知用户存入了哪个知识库\n4. 置信度低或有歧义时，列出候选知识库让用户选择\n5. 用户未提及知识库时，**不要擅自存入**任何知识库\n\n---\n\n## 添加笔记到知识库\n\n```\nPOST https://openapi.biji.com/open/api/v1/resource/knowledge/note/batch-add\nContent-Type: application/json\n```\n\n请求体：\n```json\n{\n  \"topic_id\": \"abc123\",\n  \"note_ids\": [123456789, 123456790]\n}\n```\n\n⚠️ 每批最多 20 条。已存在的笔记会跳过。\n\n---\n\n## 从知识库移除笔记\n\n```\nPOST https://openapi.biji.com/open/api/v1/resource/knowledge/note/remove\nContent-Type: application/json\n```\n\n请求体：\n```json\n{\n  \"topic_id\": \"abc123\",\n  \"note_ids\": [123456789]\n}\n```\n\n返回：\n```json\n{\"removed_count\": 1}\n```\n\n---\n\n## API 配额查询\n\n```bash\ngetnote quota\ngetnote quota -o json\n```\n\n返回 read / write / write_note 各维度的日配额和月配额（used / limit / remaining / reset_at）。\n\n---\n\n## 博主订阅\n\n### 博主列表\n\n**CLI 命令（推荐）**：\n```bash\ngetnote kb bloggers <topic_id>\ngetnote kb bloggers <topic_id> --page 2\ngetnote kb bloggers <topic_id> -o json\n```\n\n**直接调 API**：\n```\nGET https://openapi.biji.com/open/api/v1/resource/knowledge/bloggers?topic_id={topic_id}&page=1\n```\n\n参数：\n- `topic_id` (string, 必填) - 知识库 ID（来自 `/knowledge/list` 的 `topic_id` 字段）\n- `page`: 页码，从 1 开始\n\n每页固定 20 条，用 `has_more` 判断。\n\n返回 `bloggers[]`，每项字段：\n\n| 字段 | 说明 |\n|------|------|\n| follow_id | 订阅关系 ID，**查博主内容时必用** |\n| account_name | 博主名称 |\n| account_icon | 博主头像 |\n| platform | 平台（如 DEDAO）|\n| account_url | 博主主页链接 |\n| follow_time | 订阅时间（YYYY-MM-DD HH:MM:SS）|\n\n### 博主内容列表\n\n**CLI 命令（推荐）**：\n```bash\ngetnote kb blogger-contents <topic_id> <follow_id>\ngetnote kb blogger-contents <topic_id> <follow_id> --page 2\n```\n\n**直接调 API**：\n```\nGET https://openapi.biji.com/open/api/v1/resource/knowledge/blogger/contents?topic_id={topic_id}&follow_id={follow_id}&page=1\n```\n\n参数：`topic_id`（知识库 ID）、`follow_id`（博主订阅 ID）、`page`（页码）\n\n返回 `contents[]`，关键字段：`post_id_alias`（详情必用）、`post_title`、`post_summary`。\n\n> 列表不含原文，需要原文请调详情接口。完整字段见 [api-details.md](api-details.md#博主内容字段说明)。\n\n### 博主内容详情（含原文）\n\n**CLI 命令（推荐）**：\n```bash\ngetnote kb blogger-content <topic_id> <post_id_alias>\ngetnote kb blogger-content <topic_id> <post_id_alias> -o json\n```\n\n**直接调 API**：\n```\nGET https://openapi.biji.com/open/api/v1/resource/knowledge/blogger/content/detail?topic_id={topic_id}&post_id={post_id_alias}\n```\n\n参数：`topic_id`（知识库 ID）、`post_id`（内容 ID，来自列表的 `post_id_alias`）\n\n返回完整内容，包含 `post_media_text`（原文）。\n\n---\n\n## 直播订阅\n\n### 已完成直播列表\n\n**CLI 命令（推荐）**：\n```bash\ngetnote kb lives <topic_id>\ngetnote kb lives <topic_id> --page 2\n```\n\n**直接调 API**：\n```\nGET https://openapi.biji.com/open/api/v1/resource/knowledge/lives?topic_id={topic_id}&page=1\n```\n\n参数：`topic_id`（知识库 ID）、`page`（页码）\n\n返回 `lives[]`，关键字段：\n- `live_id`：直播 ID（**字符串**，详情接口传此值）\n- `name`、`status`\n\n**只返回已结束且 AI 已处理完的直播。** 完整字段见 [api-details.md](api-details.md#直播字段说明)。\n\n### 直播详情（总结 + 原文）\n\n**CLI 命令（推荐）**：\n```bash\ngetnote kb live <topic_id> <live_id>\ngetnote kb live <topic_id> <live_id> -o json\n```\n\n**直接调 API**：\n```\nGET https://openapi.biji.com/open/api/v1/resource/knowledge/live/detail?topic_id={topic_id}&live_id={live_id}\n```\n\n参数：\n- `topic_id`（知识库 ID）\n- `live_id`（**字符串**，来自列表的 `live_id` 字段）\n\n返回完整内容，包含 `post_summary`（AI 摘要）和 `post_media_text`（原文转写）。\n\n---\n\n## 展示模板\n\n知识库列表：\n> 📚 你有 {N} 个知识库：\n>\n> 1. **{name}** — {description}（{note_count} 篇笔记，{blogger_count} 个博主）\n> 2. ...\n\n添加成功：\n> ✅ 已将「{note_title}」加入知识库「{kb_name}」\n"}],"isError":false,"timestamp":1775372909596}}
{"type":"message","id":"2ae0cf30","parentId":"3f929602","timestamp":"2026-04-05T07:08:38.885Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"Now I know the correct API endpoint. Let me call it.","thinkingSignature":"18e8fb76212c12f3268032438b96a48d9e0cedebc43f6367e3c6c5b8237b040a"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_function_pmon2dkdv83t_1","name":"exec","arguments":{"command":"export GETNOTE_API_KEY=\"gk_live_79414cc5d34021a6.f48b009c9ed9470d05fbec8f4ef919f4d657e7a15d91347a\"\nexport GETNOTE_CLIENT_ID=\"cli_a1b2c3d4e5f6789012345678abcdef90\"\n\ncurl -s -X GET \"https://openapi.biji.com/open/api/v1/resource/knowledge/list?page=1\" \\\n  -H \"Authorization: $GETNOTE_API_KEY\" \\\n  -H \"X-Client-ID: $GETNOTE_CLIENT_ID\""}}],"api":"anthropic-messages","provider":"minimax","model":"MiniMax-M2.7","usage":{"input":77167,"output":169,"cacheRead":39291,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":116627,"cost":{"input":0.0231501,"output":0.0002028,"cacheRead":0.0023574599999999996,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0.025710359999999998}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1775372909604,"responseId":"06213d6ebe927a68f68dd82031a7f91b"}}
{"type":"message","id":"892c279d","parentId":"2ae0cf30","timestamp":"2026-04-05T07:08:39.321Z","message":{"role":"toolResult","toolCallId":"call_function_pmon2dkdv83t_1","toolName":"exec","content":[{"type":"text","text":"{\"success\":true,\"data\":{\"topics\":[{\"id\":\"Q0QR8KyJ\",\"topic_id\":\"Q0QR8KyJ\",\"name\":\"网络安全\",\"description\":\"\",\"cover\":\"\",\"scope\":\"DEFAULT\",\"created_at\":\"2026-01-26 09:32:00\",\"updated_at\":\"2026-01-27 10:46:51\",\"stats\":{\"note_count\":1,\"file_count\":3,\"live_count\":0,\"blogger_count\":0}},{\"id\":\"RYkNrbxn\",\"topic_id\":\"RYkNrbxn\",\"name\":\"供应链管理\",\"description\":\"\",\"cover\":\"\",\"scope\":\"DEFAULT\",\"created_at\":\"2026-01-25 15:45:53\",\"updated_at\":\"2026-01-26 08:14:32\",\"stats\":{\"note_count\":3,\"file_count\":0,\"live_count\":0,\"blogger_count\":0}},{\"id\":\"Q0GlxgqJ\",\"topic_id\":\"Q0GlxgqJ\",\"name\":\"投资与金融\",\"description\":\"\",\"cover\":\"\",\"scope\":\"DEFAULT\",\"created_at\":\"2025-12-20 14:03:52\",\"updated_at\":\"2026-03-07 13:14:24\",\"stats\":{\"note_count\":44,\"file_count\":7,\"live_count\":0,\"blogger_count\":0}},{\"id\":\"EJl1l3yn\",\"topic_id\":\"EJl1l3yn\",\"name\":\"一老一小\",\"description\":\"\",\"cover\":\"\",\"scope\":\"DEFAULT\",\"created_at\":\"2025-10-08 10:46:00\",\"updated_at\":\"2026-03-12 09:06:14\",\"stats\":{\"note_count\":5,\"file_count\":5,\"live_count\":0,\"blogger_count\":0}},{\"id\":\"qnNz5dn5\",\"topic_id\":\"qnNz5dn5\",\"name\":\"孩子教育\",\"description\":\"\",\"cover\":\"\",\"scope\":\"DEFAULT\",\"created_at\":\"2025-02-16 11:02:13\",\"updated_at\":\"2026-04-04 10:04:25\",\"stats\":{\"note_count\":31,\"file_count\":3,\"live_count\":0,\"blogger_count\":2}},{\"id\":\"eYzm44nm\",\"topic_id\":\"eYzm44nm\",\"name\":\"AI使用技巧\",\"description\":\"\",\"cover\":\"\",\"scope\":\"DEFAULT\",\"created_at\":\"2025-02-15 17:02:08\",\"updated_at\":\"2026-03-15 21:02:50\",\"stats\":{\"note_count\":72,\"file_count\":4,\"live_count\":3,\"blogger_count\":0}},{\"id\":\"9YeBam0m\",\"topic_id\":\"9YeBam0m\",\"name\":\"芯片业务相关\",\"description\":\"\",\"cover\":\"\",\"scope\":\"DEFAULT\",\"created_at\":\"2025-02-04 11:49:32\",\"updated_at\":\"2026-02-01 11:12:17\",\"stats\":{\"note_count\":195,\"file_count\":161,\"live_count\":0,\"blogger_count\":0}}],\"has_more\":false,\"total\":7},\"error\":null,\"meta\":{\"timestamp\":1775372919},\"request_id\":\"f2bcaf175ed1001\"}"}],"details":{"status":"completed","exitCode":0,"durationMs":390,"aggregated":"{\"success\":true,\"data\":{\"topics\":[{\"id\":\"Q0QR8KyJ\",\"topic_id\":\"Q0QR8KyJ\",\"name\":\"网络安全\",\"description\":\"\",\"cover\":\"\",\"scope\":\"DEFAULT\",\"created_at\":\"2026-01-26 09:32:00\",\"updated_at\":\"2026-01-27 10:46:51\",\"stats\":{\"note_count\":1,\"file_count\":3,\"live_count\":0,\"blogger_count\":0}},{\"id\":\"RYkNrbxn\",\"topic_id\":\"RYkNrbxn\",\"name\":\"供应链管理\",\"description\":\"\",\"cover\":\"\",\"scope\":\"DEFAULT\",\"created_at\":\"2026-01-25 15:45:53\",\"updated_at\":\"2026-01-26 08:14:32\",\"stats\":{\"note_count\":3,\"file_count\":0,\"live_count\":0,\"blogger_count\":0}},{\"id\":\"Q0GlxgqJ\",\"topic_id\":\"Q0GlxgqJ\",\"name\":\"投资与金融\",\"description\":\"\",\"cover\":\"\",\"scope\":\"DEFAULT\",\"created_at\":\"2025-12-20 14:03:52\",\"updated_at\":\"2026-03-07 13:14:24\",\"stats\":{\"note_count\":44,\"file_count\":7,\"live_count\":0,\"blogger_count\":0}},{\"id\":\"EJl1l3yn\",\"topic_id\":\"EJl1l3yn\",\"name\":\"一老一小\",\"description\":\"\",\"cover\":\"\",\"scope\":\"DEFAULT\",\"created_at\":\"2025-10-08 10:46:00\",\"updated_at\":\"2026-03-12 09:06:14\",\"stats\":{\"note_count\":5,\"file_count\":5,\"live_count\":0,\"blogger_count\":0}},{\"id\":\"qnNz5dn5\",\"topic_id\":\"qnNz5dn5\",\"name\":\"孩子教育\",\"description\":\"\",\"cover\":\"\",\"scope\":\"DEFAULT\",\"created_at\":\"2025-02-16 11:02:13\",\"updated_at\":\"2026-04-04 10:04:25\",\"stats\":{\"note_count\":31,\"file_count\":3,\"live_count\":0,\"blogger_count\":2}},{\"id\":\"eYzm44nm\",\"topic_id\":\"eYzm44nm\",\"name\":\"AI使用技巧\",\"description\":\"\",\"cover\":\"\",\"scope\":\"DEFAULT\",\"created_at\":\"2025-02-15 17:02:08\",\"updated_at\":\"2026-03-15 21:02:50\",\"stats\":{\"note_count\":72,\"file_count\":4,\"live_count\":3,\"blogger_count\":0}},{\"id\":\"9YeBam0m\",\"topic_id\":\"9YeBam0m\",\"name\":\"芯片业务相关\",\"description\":\"\",\"cover\":\"\",\"scope\":\"DEFAULT\",\"created_at\":\"2025-02-04 11:49:32\",\"updated_at\":\"2026-02-01 11:12:17\",\"stats\":{\"note_count\":195,\"file_count\":161,\"live_count\":0,\"blogger_count\":0}}],\"has_more\":false,\"total\":7},\"error\":null,\"meta\":{\"timestamp\":1775372919},\"request_id\":\"f2bcaf175ed1001\"}","cwd":"/Users/edy/.openclaw/workspace"},"isError":false,"timestamp":1775372919308}}
{"type":"message","id":"b0f406b5","parentId":"892c279d","timestamp":"2026-04-05T07:08:49.994Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"Found the knowledge bases. Let me present them to the user. Also, the user wanted me to:\n1. Read the knowledge bases\n2. Remember the location for future reference\n3. Organize the 4 geography PPTs into notes\n\nLet me present the knowledge bases first, then ask what to do next. The user specifically asked about \"孩子教育\" knowledge base, and the geography materials could go there or in other related places.\n\nLet me tell the user what knowledge bases they have. Also I should remember these for future reference.","thinkingSignature":"39af6616309f289073864a53f558949b2848448af66220ca112ddaa8b371bcea"},{"type":"text","text":"你有 **7个自建知识库** 📚\n\n| 知识库 | 笔记数 | 文件数 | 直播数 | 博主订阅 |\n|--------|--------|--------|--------|---------|\n| **芯片业务相关** | 195 | 161 | - | - |\n| **AI使用技巧** | 72 | 4 | 3 | - |\n| **投资与金融** | 44 | 7 | - | - |\n| **孩子教育** | 31 | 3 | - | 2 |\n| **一老一小** | 5 | 5 | - | - |\n| **供应链管理** | 3 | - | - | - |\n| **网络安全** | 1 | 3 | - | - |\n\n---\n\n关于刚才的地理PPT，**生地会考复习资料**建议：\n- 存入 **「孩子教育」** 知识库（`topic_id: qnNz5dn5`）\n- 或者单独建一个 **「生地会考」** 知识库\n\n你想怎么存？另外要把整理好的复习笔记也一起写进去吗？"}],"api":"anthropic-messages","provider":"minimax","model":"MiniMax-M2.7","usage":{"input":78016,"output":341,"cacheRead":39291,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":117648,"cost":{"input":0.0234048,"output":0.00040919999999999997,"cacheRead":0.0023574599999999996,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0.026171459999999997}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1775372919322,"responseId":"06213d777a62ef9fc4b342c4ed008e16"}}
