{"type":"message","id":"decca728","parentId":"66599a12","timestamp":"2026-04-05T07:49:51.837Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"The user wants to set up a weekly summary every Sunday at 21:00. This should review all new notes from Get笔记 (not just education-related). Let me update the HEARTBEAT.md to add this weekly review function.\n\nI need to:\n1. Update HEARTBEAT.md to add the weekly Sunday 21:00 review task\n2. The review should cover all notes, not just education\n3. It should be a summary analysis\n\nActually, looking at HEARTBEAT.md more carefully, it mentions cron scheduling. But for a specific time like \"每周日21点\", I should use a cron job rather than heartbeat. Let me think about this...\n\nThe heartbeat mechanism is for periodic self-checks. But what the user wants is a cron task at a specific time. I should use cron.\n\nActually, looking at the AGENTS.md, it mentions:\n- Heartbeat vs Cron: When to use each\n- Cron for exact timing\n\nSo I should set up a cron job for \"每周日21点\" (every Sunday 21:00).\n\nBut first, let me read the current HEARTBEAT.md to understand its structure, then add the weekly Get笔记 review to it, and also check if there's a cron mechanism in place.\n\nLet me update HEARTBEAT.md first, then check what cron setup exists.","thinkingSignature":"a7d433100696d93bd2812eb1d7c64c3e5d60c183cfab4f4ef2bc94f75e58ded9"},{"type":"text","text":"好，我先读一下现有的 HEARTBEAT.md，然后更新它：\n"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_function_wbjhpx9ntvu9_1","name":"read","arguments":{"path":"/Users/edy/.openclaw/workspace/HEARTBEAT.md"}}],"api":"anthropic-messages","provider":"minimax","model":"MiniMax-M2.7","usage":{"input":130,"output":330,"cacheRead":151319,"cacheWrite":594,"totalTokens":152373,"cost":{"input":0.000039,"output":0.000396,"cacheRead":0.00907914,"cacheWrite":0.00022275,"total":0.00973689}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1775375379249,"responseId":"06214713d7095dd4cfa977019bc0f8da"}}
{"type":"message","id":"d4371b26","parentId":"decca728","timestamp":"2026-04-05T07:49:51.895Z","message":{"role":"toolResult","toolCallId":"call_function_wbjhpx9ntvu9_1","toolName":"read","content":[{"type":"text","text":"# HEARTBEAT.md\n\n## 每日复盘（日终自动执行）\n\n每天 21:00-22:00 自动执行日终复盘：\n\n1. **读取今日 memory 文件**：`memory/YYYY-MM-DD.md`\n2. **总结今天完成的事项**：\n   - 帮频哥解决了什么问题\n   - 学到了什么新知识/经验\n   - 有哪些待跟进事项\n3. **更新 MEMORY.md**：把重要的、新学到的东西提炼进去\n4. **更新 .learnings/**：如果今天有错误/学到，把内容记入 `.learnings/` 对应文件\n5. **推送到 git**：如果 workspace 有变化，执行 `git add && git commit`\n6. **Get笔记辅导启发审查**：读取 Get笔记 最近20条，筛选与兮兮/教育相关的内容，提炼辅导启发，更新到 MEMORY.md「Get笔记每日辅导启发」章节\n\n## 周深信息提醒\n\n- 如果还没收到频哥关于女儿喜欢周深哪些歌的回复，在日终复盘时提醒自己\"待确认\"\n- 跟进状态记录在 TODO.md\n\n## 错题本流程\n\n- 确保图片上传流程畅通\n- 如果遇到上传问题，记录到 .learnings/ERRORS.md\n\n## 周期性提醒检查\n\n每次 heartbeat 时检查 `memory/heartbeat-state.json` 中的 `reminders`：\n\n1. 读取 reminders 配置\n2. 判断今天是处于哪个 phase（phase1 或 phase2）\n3. 判断今天是否需要提醒：\n   - phase1：只在配置的 days（monday/wednesday/friday）提醒\n   - phase2：每天提醒\n4. 如果需要提醒，发送消息给频哥\n\n**提醒内容从 heartbeat-state.json 的 message 字段读取，不要hardcode。**\n"}],"isError":false,"timestamp":1775375391887}}
{"type":"message","id":"2dfa69ed","parentId":"d4371b26","timestamp":"2026-04-05T07:50:09.142Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"Now I need to:\n1. Update HEARTBEAT.md to add a \"每周日21点Get笔记全站复盘\"\n2. This should search all notes from the past week, not just education\n3. The cron setup should be checked too\n\nLet me first update HEARTBEAT.md with the weekly review function.","thinkingSignature":"704ca034f597a8881df21a444d79370509188a1681beaa97a5f985ca6580a95e"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_function_3khjsr9r8kbm_1","name":"edit","arguments":{"path":"/Users/edy/.openclaw/workspace/HEARTBEAT.md","edits":[{"oldText":"## 周期性提醒检查","newText":"## 每周日 Get笔记全站复盘（周日 21:00 执行）\n\n每周日 21:00 自动执行，检查上一周新增的笔记，进行全站复盘：\n\n### 复盘范围\n- **不限于教育**，覆盖全部知识库（芯片/AI/投资/供应链/一老一小等）\n- 用语义搜索按周检索：`created_at:最近一周`\n- 统计各知识库新增笔记数量\n\n### 复盘内容\n1. **新增笔记概览**：本周各知识库新增了多少条\n2. **重点笔记摘要**：挑选 3-5 条最有价值的笔记，说明价值点\n3. **值得关注的变化**：比如新增了某个系列内容、某个领域笔记增多等\n4. **行动建议**：是否需要深入学习某个话题、是否值得转发给兮兮\n\n### 输出格式\n```\n📅 周复盘 | 4月第1周（3.30-4.5）\n\n📊 新增概况\n- 芯片业务相关：+12篇\n- AI使用技巧：+5篇\n- 孩子教育：+3篇\n- ...\n\n💡 重点笔记\n1. [标题]（知识库）——一句话说明价值\n2. ...\n\n🔔 值得关注\n- ...\n\n💬 行动建议\n- ...\n```\n\n### 执行方式\n1. 调用 Get笔记 recall 接口，按各知识库搜索\"最近一周\"的关键词\n2. 或者用 list 接口遍历各知识库，按时间过滤\n3. 整理后通过飞书发送给频哥\n\n---\n\n## 周期性提醒检查"}]}}],"api":"anthropic-messages","provider":"minimax","model":"MiniMax-M2.7","usage":{"input":113465,"output":499,"cacheRead":39291,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":153255,"cost":{"input":0.0340395,"output":0.0005988,"cacheRead":0.0023574599999999996,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0.036995759999999996}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1775375391896,"responseId":"0621472088f03e0823537f93c8eb22f6"}}
