{"type":"message","id":"a696c125","parentId":"52c3e396","timestamp":"2026-04-05T07:50:22.970Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"Now I need to also set up the cron job for every Sunday at 21:00. Let me check how cron is configured in this workspace. Looking at MEMORY.md, there's mention of a backup cron job. Let me check if there's a way to set up the cron for the weekly Get笔记 review.Actually, I should check if OpenClaw has a built-in cron mechanism. Looking at AGENTS.md:\n\n\"### Heartbeat vs Cron: When to Use Each\n\n**Use heartbeat when:**\n- Multiple checks can batch together (inbox + calendar + notifications in one turn)\n- You need conversational context from recent messages\n- Timing can drift slightly (every ~30 min is fine, not exact)\n\n**Use cron when:**\n- Exact timing matters (\\\"9:00 AM sharp every Monday\\\")\"\n- Task needs isolation from main session history\n- One-shot reminders (\\\"remind me in 20 minutes\\\")\"\n\nSo I should set up a cron job. But I need to figure out how to do that in OpenClaw. Let me check if there's a way to create a cron task.Actually, looking at the MEMORY.md backup entry, it seems like the backup script is run via system cron. For the weekly review, I should probably set up a similar cron job or an OpenClaw cron task.\n\nFor now, let me update HEARTBEAT.md as I've done, and mention to the user that the cron timing needs to be set up. Actually, OpenClaw has a cron feature - let me check if there's documentation on how to set up scheduled tasks.Actually, the simplest approach might be to add this to the heartbeat mechanism - but heartbeat runs more frequently (every 30 min or so), not just on Sunday 21:00.\n\nWait - I think OpenClaw has built-in cron support. \n\nI should verify what cron mechanisms are actually available in the system before deciding whether to use the built-in scheduler or system-level cron.","thinkingSignature":"fea36c9d309e785f6d89d8f82c2bc86bb1005b8512e9ff915f037a1167a8e216"},{"type":"text","text":"HEARTBEAT.md 已更新。现在需要设置 cron 定时任务，让我检查一下如何配置：\n"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_function_hoe6dhhna5xt_1","name":"exec","arguments":{"command":"ls ~/.openclaw/workspace/scripts/ 2>/dev/null && cat ~/.openclaw/workspace/scripts/*.sh 2>/dev/null | head -50"}}],"api":"anthropic-messages","provider":"minimax","model":"MiniMax-M2.7","usage":{"input":114003,"output":480,"cacheRead":39291,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":153774,"cost":{"input":0.0342009,"output":0.000576,"cacheRead":0.0023574599999999996,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0.03713436}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1775375409206,"responseId":"062147317069be5539c4d7b572eb937c"}}
{"type":"message","id":"6c16e038","parentId":"a696c125","timestamp":"2026-04-05T07:50:23.040Z","message":{"role":"toolResult","toolCallId":"call_function_hoe6dhhna5xt_1","toolName":"exec","content":[{"type":"text","text":"gen_better_diagrams.py\ngen_diagrams.py\ngen_pdf.py\ngen_word.py\ngenerate_paper.py\nopenclaw-backup.sh\n#!/bin/bash\n# openclaw-backup.sh - 每天备份 OpenClaw 关键配置文件\n# 使用方法: 加入 crontab: 0 3 * * * /Users/edy/.openclaw/workspace/scripts/openclaw-backup.sh\n\nWORKSPACE=\"$HOME/.openclaw/workspace\"\nBACKUP_DIR=\"$WORKSPACE/.backup\"\nOPENCLAW_DIR=\"$HOME/.openclaw\"\nLOG_FILE=\"$WORKSPACE/.backup.log\"\nSTATUS=\"✅ 备份成功\"\nDATE=$(date +%Y-%m-%d)\n\necho \"📦 开始备份... $DATE\"\n\n# 清理旧备份\nrm -rf \"$BACKUP_DIR\"\nmkdir -p \"$BACKUP_DIR\"\n\n# ===== OpenClaw 配置文件（不含 node_modules） =====\necho \"📁 备份 OpenClaw 配置...\"\nmkdir -p \"$BACKUP_DIR/openclaw\"\ncp \"$OPENCLAW_DIR/openclaw.json\" \"$BACKUP_DIR/openclaw/\"\ncp \"$OPENCLAW_DIR/exec-approvals.json\" \"$BACKUP_DIR/openclaw/\" 2>/dev/null\ncp \"$OPENCLAW_DIR/wechat-access-auth.json\" \"$BACKUP_DIR/openclaw/\" 2>/dev/null\n\n# 备份关键目录（排除 node_modules）\nfor dir in identity credentials agents subagents; do\n  if [ -d \"$OPENCLAW_DIR/$dir\" ]; then\n    mkdir -p \"$BACKUP_DIR/openclaw/$dir\"\n    cp -r \"$OPENCLAW_DIR/$dir\"/* \"$BACKUP_DIR/openclaw/$dir/\" 2>/dev/null\n  fi\ndone\n\n# ===== Skills（用户创建的） =====\necho \"📁 备份 Skills...\"\nmkdir -p \"$BACKUP_DIR/skills\"\ncp -r \"$WORKSPACE/skills\" \"$BACKUP_DIR/skills/\" 2>/dev/null\ncp \"$WORKSPACE\"/*.skill \"$BACKUP_DIR/skills/\" 2>/dev/null\n\n# ===== memory 文件（对话记录、每日分析） =====\necho \"📁 备份 memory...\"\nmkdir -p \"$BACKUP_DIR/memory\"\ncp -r \"$WORKSPACE/memory\" \"$BACKUP_DIR/memory/\" 2>/dev/null\n\n# ===== 打包成 tar.gz =====\ncd \"$BACKUP_DIR\"\necho \"📦 打包...\"\nBACKUP_TAR=\"$WORKSPACE/openclaw_backup_${DATE}.tar.gz\"\ntar -czf \"$BACKUP_TAR\" openclaw skills memory 2>/dev/null\nTAR_SIZE=$(du -h \"$BACKUP_TAR\" | cut -f1)\necho \"📦 打包完成: $TAR_SIZE\""}],"details":{"status":"completed","exitCode":0,"durationMs":24,"aggregated":"gen_better_diagrams.py\ngen_diagrams.py\ngen_pdf.py\ngen_word.py\ngenerate_paper.py\nopenclaw-backup.sh\n#!/bin/bash\n# openclaw-backup.sh - 每天备份 OpenClaw 关键配置文件\n# 使用方法: 加入 crontab: 0 3 * * * /Users/edy/.openclaw/workspace/scripts/openclaw-backup.sh\n\nWORKSPACE=\"$HOME/.openclaw/workspace\"\nBACKUP_DIR=\"$WORKSPACE/.backup\"\nOPENCLAW_DIR=\"$HOME/.openclaw\"\nLOG_FILE=\"$WORKSPACE/.backup.log\"\nSTATUS=\"✅ 备份成功\"\nDATE=$(date +%Y-%m-%d)\n\necho \"📦 开始备份... $DATE\"\n\n# 清理旧备份\nrm -rf \"$BACKUP_DIR\"\nmkdir -p \"$BACKUP_DIR\"\n\n# ===== OpenClaw 配置文件（不含 node_modules） =====\necho \"📁 备份 OpenClaw 配置...\"\nmkdir -p \"$BACKUP_DIR/openclaw\"\ncp \"$OPENCLAW_DIR/openclaw.json\" \"$BACKUP_DIR/openclaw/\"\ncp \"$OPENCLAW_DIR/exec-approvals.json\" \"$BACKUP_DIR/openclaw/\" 2>/dev/null\ncp \"$OPENCLAW_DIR/wechat-access-auth.json\" \"$BACKUP_DIR/openclaw/\" 2>/dev/null\n\n# 备份关键目录（排除 node_modules）\nfor dir in identity credentials agents subagents; do\n  if [ -d \"$OPENCLAW_DIR/$dir\" ]; then\n    mkdir -p \"$BACKUP_DIR/openclaw/$dir\"\n    cp -r \"$OPENCLAW_DIR/$dir\"/* \"$BACKUP_DIR/openclaw/$dir/\" 2>/dev/null\n  fi\ndone\n\n# ===== Skills（用户创建的） =====\necho \"📁 备份 Skills...\"\nmkdir -p \"$BACKUP_DIR/skills\"\ncp -r \"$WORKSPACE/skills\" \"$BACKUP_DIR/skills/\" 2>/dev/null\ncp \"$WORKSPACE\"/*.skill \"$BACKUP_DIR/skills/\" 2>/dev/null\n\n# ===== memory 文件（对话记录、每日分析） =====\necho \"📁 备份 memory...\"\nmkdir -p \"$BACKUP_DIR/memory\"\ncp -r \"$WORKSPACE/memory\" \"$BACKUP_DIR/memory/\" 2>/dev/null\n\n# ===== 打包成 tar.gz =====\ncd \"$BACKUP_DIR\"\necho \"📦 打包...\"\nBACKUP_TAR=\"$WORKSPACE/openclaw_backup_${DATE}.tar.gz\"\ntar -czf \"$BACKUP_TAR\" openclaw skills memory 2>/dev/null\nTAR_SIZE=$(du -h \"$BACKUP_TAR\" | cut -f1)\necho \"📦 打包完成: $TAR_SIZE\"","cwd":"/Users/edy/.openclaw/workspace"},"isError":false,"timestamp":1775375423032}}
{"type":"message","id":"93250ef1","parentId":"6c16e038","timestamp":"2026-04-05T07:51:03.519Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"I see the backup script uses system crontab. For the weekly review, I should create a separate script and add a cron entry. Let me create the weekly review script and add a cron job for it.The cron entry would be:\n`0 21 * * 0` (every Sunday at 21:00)\n\nLet me create the weekly review script and then tell the user they need to add the cron entry.Actually, wait - I should think about this differently. The weekly review needs to:\n1. Search Get笔记 for notes created in the past week\n2. Analyze them and send a summary to 频哥\n\nThe challenge is that Get笔记 API only supports recall (semantic search), not date-based filtering. So I'll need to use a workaround - perhaps searching for recent dates in the content, or just doing a broad recall and filtering.\n\nActually, looking at the recall API, it doesn't support date filtering either. The most practical approach would be:\n1. Do semantic searches for recent topics\n2. Or just search broad topics and manually identify recent ones\n\nBut wait - I don't think cron's `0 21 * * 0` is the right format. Let me think about this...\n\nActually, let me just:\n1. Create the script\n2. Ask 频哥 to add the cron entry (or add it via a tool)\n\nLet me create the script first.","thinkingSignature":"239a3c2ea1a70f54418e55b58e46e6b3abe54920478c5c43edd7272bd442cefc"},{"type":"text","text":"需要创建一个每周复盘的脚本，然后加到 crontab。让我先建脚本：\n"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_function_2knfjj3dafhx_1","name":"write","arguments":{"path":"/Users/edy/.openclaw/workspace/scripts/getnote-weekly-review.sh","content":"#!/bin/bash\n# getnote-weekly-review.sh - 每周日Get笔记全站复盘\n# 使用方法: 加入 crontab: 0 21 * * 0 /Users/edy/.openclaw/workspace/scripts/getnote-weekly-review.sh\n\nWORKSPACE=\"$HOME/.openclaw/workspace\"\nLOG_FILE=\"$WORKSPACE/.backup.log\"\nDATE=$(date +%Y-%m-%d)\nWEEK=$(date +%Y年第%V周)\nDATE_FROM=$(date -v-7d +%Y-%m-%d)\n\necho \"📅 开始每周Get笔记复盘... $DATE\"\n\n# 读取 Get笔记 配置\nsource \"$WORKSPACE/scripts/getnote-env.sh\" 2>/dev/null\n\nif [ -z \"$GETNOTE_API_KEY\" ] || [ -z \"$GETNOTE_CLIENT_ID\" ]; then\n    echo \"❌ Get笔记 API Key 未配置，跳过复盘\"\n    exit 1\nfi\n\n# ===== 搜索各知识库最近一周的内容 =====\n# 由于API不支持按日期过滤，使用语义搜索代替\n\nREVIEW_FILE=\"$WORKSPACE/memory/getnote_weekly_review_${DATE}.md\"\n\ncat > \"$REVIEW_FILE\" << EOF\n# 📅 周复盘 | $WEEK（$DATE_FROM ~ $DATE）\n\n> 自动生成 $(date +%Y-%m-%d\\ %H:%M)\n\nEOF\n\n# 搜索函数\nsearch_and_append() {\n    local query=\"$1\"\n    local section=\"$2\"\n    echo \"\" >> \"$REVIEW_FILE\"\n    echo \"## $section\" >> \"$REVIEW_FILE\"\n    echo \"\" >> \"$REVIEW_FILE\"\n    \n    result=$(curl -s -X POST \"https://openapi.biji.com/open/api/v1/resource/recall\" \\\n        -H \"Content-Type: application/json\" \\\n        -H \"Authorization: $GETNOTE_API_KEY\" \\\n        -H \"X-Client-ID: $GETNOTE_CLIENT_ID\" \\\n        -d \"{\\\"query\\\":\\\"$query\\\",\\\"top_k\\\":5}\" 2>/dev/null)\n    \n    echo \"$result\" | python3 -c \"\nimport sys, json\ntry:\n    data = json.load(sys.stdin)\n    results = data.get('data', {}).get('results', [])\n    if results:\n        for r in results[:5]:\n            title = r.get('title', '无标题')\n            content = r.get('content', '')[:200]\n            note_type = r.get('note_type', '')\n            created = r.get('created_at', '')\n            print(f'### {title}')\n            print(f'> 类型: {note_type} | 创建: {created}')\n            print(f'> {content}...')\n            print('')\n    else:\n        print('*(无相关笔记)*')\nexcept Exception as e:\n    print(f'*(搜索出错: {e})*')\n\" >> \"$REVIEW_FILE\"\n}\n\n# ===== 按知识库大类搜索 =====\n\necho \"📊 搜索最近一周新增笔记...\"\n\n# 芯片业务相关\nsearch_and_append \"芯片 半导体 最近\" \"芯片业务相关\"\n\n# AI使用技巧\nsearch_and_append \"AI 工具 使用技巧 最近\" \"AI使用技巧\"\n\n# 投资与金融\nsearch_and_append \"投资 金融 市场 最近\" \"投资与金融\"\n\n# 孩子教育\nsearch_and_append \"孩子 教育 学习 兮兮 最近\" \"孩子教育\"\n\n# 供应链管理\nsearch_and_append \"供应链 采购 最近\" \"供应链管理\"\n\n# 一老一小\nsearch_and_append \"养老 医疗 健康 最近\" \"一老一小\"\n\n# 网络安全\nsearch_and_append \"网络安全 数据 最近\" \"网络安全\"\n\n# ===== 生成总结 =====\n\ncat >> \"$REVIEW_FILE\" << 'EOF'\n\n---\n\n## 💬 行动建议\n\n本周值得关注的内容：\n- \n- \n\n*由 OpenClaw 自动生成，如需调整请告知*\nEOF\n\necho \"📝 复盘文件已生成: $REVIEW_FILE\"\n\n# ===== 发送飞书通知 =====\n\npython3 << 'PYEOF'\nimport subprocess, json, sys, os, datetime\n\nAPP_ID = \"cli_a93534f5edb85bd3\"\nCONFIG_FILE = os.path.expanduser(\"~/.openclaw/openclaw.json\")\nwith open(CONFIG_FILE) as f:\n    feishu_cfg = json.load(f).get(\"channels\", {}).get(\"feishu\", {})\nAPP_SECRET = feishu_cfg.get(\"appSecret\", \"\")\nUSER_OPEN_ID = \"ou_2ad19bb3863e71e2d0eff5cc4aeedd83\"\n\nresult = subprocess.run(\n    [\"curl\", \"-s\", \"-X\", \"POST\",\n     \"https://open.feishu.cn/open-apis/auth/v3/tenant_access_token/internal\",\n     \"-H\", \"Content-Type: application/json\",\n     \"-d\", json.dumps({\"app_id\": APP_ID, \"app_secret\": APP_SECRET})],\n    capture_output=True, text=True\n)\ntoken_data = json.loads(result.stdout)\napp_token = token_data.get(\"tenant_access_token\", \"\")\n\nif not app_token:\n    print(\"获取 token 失败，跳过通知\")\n    sys.exit(0)\n\n# 读取复盘文件\nreview_date = os.environ.get('DATE', datetime.datetime.now().strftime('%Y-%m-%d'))\nreview_file = os.path.expanduser(f\"~/.openclaw/workspace/memory/getnote_weekly_review_{review_date}.md\")\n\nif os.path.exists(review_file):\n    with open(review_file, 'r') as f:\n        content = f.read()\nelse:\n    content = f\"📅 Get笔记周复盘\\n\\n本周复盘文件已生成，请查看 workspace。\"\n\nnow_str = datetime.datetime.now().strftime(\"%Y-%m-%d %H:%M\")\nweek_str = datetime.datetime.now().strftime(\"年第%V周\")\n\nmsg = f\"📅 Get笔记 周复盘 | {week_str}\\n\\n📝 复盘文件已生成：memory/getnote_weekly_review_{review_date}.md\\n\\n💡 如需调整复盘内容或格式，请随时告知！\"\n\nsubprocess.run(\n    [\"curl\", \"-s\", \"-X\", \"POST\",\n     \"https://open.feishu.cn/open-apis/im/v1/messages?receive_id_type=open_id\",\n     \"-H\", \"Authorization: Bearer {app_token}\".format(app_token=app_token),\n     \"-H\", \"Content-Type: application/json\",\n     \"-d\", json.dumps({\n         \"receive_id\": USER_OPEN_ID,\n         \"msg_type\": \"text\",\n         \"content\": json.dumps({\"text\": msg})\n     })],\n    capture_output=True\n)\nprint(\"飞书通知已发送\")\nPYEOF\n\necho \"✅ 每周复盘完成: $(date)\" | tee -a \"$LOG_FILE\"\n"}}],"api":"anthropic-messages","provider":"minimax","model":"MiniMax-M2.7","usage":{"input":115068,"output":1773,"cacheRead":39291,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":156132,"cost":{"input":0.0345204,"output":0.0021276,"cacheRead":0.0023574599999999996,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0.03900546}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1775375423041,"responseId":"0621473f204b6abb3795bbdd206b2366"}}
