{"type":"message","id":"f60fb877","parentId":"21516910","timestamp":"2026-04-05T07:51:15.598Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"Now I need to create the env file that the script sources for API keys. Let me also make the script executable and tell 频哥 to add the cron entry.Actually, there's an issue - the script sources `getnote-env.sh` but that file doesn't exist. The API key is stored in openclaw.json, not a separate env file. I need to fix this.\n\nLet me also check how to properly get the API key - it was stored in openclaw.json under skills.entries.getnote.apiKey.\n\nLet me update the script to read from openclaw.json directly instead of sourcing a non-existent env file.","thinkingSignature":"f2e8ce261e72e969800033e569d88d79a6664c12518644f836607b8efb2ca321"},{"type":"text","text":"脚本里的 API Key 读取需要调整（你的 API Key 存在 openclaw.json 里）。让我修复：\n"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_function_jdqj4573x69k_1","name":"edit","arguments":{"path":"/Users/edy/.openclaw/workspace/scripts/getnote-weekly-review.sh","edits":[{"oldText":"# 读取 Get笔记 配置\nsource \"$WORKSPACE/scripts/getnote-env.sh\" 2>/dev/null\n\nif [ -z \"$GETNOTE_API_KEY\" ] || [ -z \"$GETNOTE_CLIENT_ID\" ]; then\n    echo \"❌ Get笔记 API Key 未配置，跳过复盘\"\n    exit 1\nfi","newText":"# 读取 Get笔记 配置（从 openclaw.json）\nCONFIG_FILE=\"$HOME/.openclaw/openclaw.json\"\nif [ ! -f \"$CONFIG_FILE\" ]; then\n    echo \"❌ openclaw.json 未找到，跳过复盘\"\n    exit 1\nfi\n\nGETNOTE_API_KEY=$(python3 -c \"\nimport json\nwith open('$CONFIG_FILE') as f:\n    d = json.load(f)\n    entries = d.get('skills', {}).get('entries', {})\n    getnote = entries.get('getnote', {})\n    print(getnote.get('apiKey', ''))\n\" 2>/dev/null)\n\nGETNOTE_CLIENT_ID=$(python3 -c \"\nimport json\nwith open('$CONFIG_FILE') as f:\n    d = json.load(f)\n    entries = d.get('skills', {}).get('entries', {})\n    getnote = entries.get('getnote', {})\n    env = getnote.get('env', {})\n    print(env.get('GETNOTE_CLIENT_ID', ''))\n\" 2>/dev/null)\n\nif [ -z \"$GETNOTE_API_KEY\" ] || [ -z \"$GETNOTE_CLIENT_ID\" ]; then\n    echo \"❌ Get笔记 API Key 未配置，跳过复盘\"\n    exit 1\nfi"}]}}],"api":"anthropic-messages","provider":"minimax","model":"MiniMax-M2.7","usage":{"input":116879,"output":575,"cacheRead":39291,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":156745,"cost":{"input":0.035063699999999996,"output":0.00069,"cacheRead":0.0023574599999999996,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0.03811116}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1775375463568,"responseId":"062147671475d88272eccdf0f7aae147"}}
