{"type":"message","id":"29097b9d","parentId":"639e4281","timestamp":"2026-04-05T07:51:43.052Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"API Key is properly stored. Everything is set up now. Let me give 频哥 a summary of what was done.","thinkingSignature":"6a3fc4016a9b6a8f7bb67d9af97af4516dd07e850aee04a14c8053cca8854d2a"},{"type":"text","text":"全部搞定！ ✅\n\n**已完成：**\n1. ✅ 更新 `HEARTBEAT.md` — 增加每周日Get笔记全站复盘说明\n2. ✅ 创建脚本 `scripts/getnote-weekly-review.sh` — 自动抓取各知识库笔记\n3. ✅ 已加入 crontab — **每周日 21:00 自动执行**\n\n**复盘内容：**\n- 不限于教育，**全站覆盖**（芯片/AI/投资/供应链/一老一小/安全等）\n- 各知识库新增笔记概览\n- 重点笔记摘要（每库最多5条）\n- 行动建议\n\n**文件位置：** `memory/getnote_weekly_review_YYYY-MM-DD.md`\n\n第一次执行会在**本周日（4月6日）21:00**，届时会发飞书通知 📲"}],"api":"anthropic-messages","provider":"minimax","model":"MiniMax-M2.7","usage":{"input":118246,"output":201,"cacheRead":39291,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":157738,"cost":{"input":0.0354738,"output":0.00024119999999999998,"cacheRead":0.0023574599999999996,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0.038072459999999995}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1775375494953,"responseId":"0621478749411a48770d33105a2bdbff"}}
{"type":"message","id":"91c72440","parentId":"29097b9d","timestamp":"2026-04-05T07:52:01.350Z","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"type":"text","text":"[media attached: /Users/edy/.openclaw/media/inbound/51913d11-76e5-4cdc-a59e-6a35428486d2.jpg (image/jpeg) | /Users/edy/.openclaw/media/inbound/51913d11-76e5-4cdc-a59e-6a35428486d2.jpg]\nTo send an image back, prefer the message tool (media/path/filePath). If you must inline, use MEDIA:https://example.com/image.jpg (spaces ok, quote if needed) or a safe relative path like MEDIA:./image.jpg. Avoid absolute paths (MEDIA:/...) and ~ paths — they are blocked for security. Keep caption in the text body.\nSystem: [2026-04-05 15:51:59 GMT+8] Feishu[default] DM | 用户612847 (ou_2ad19bb3863e71e2d0eff5cc4aeedd83) [msg:om_x100b5215072e48acc4d4cd575f2c466, image, 1 attachment(s)]\n\nConversation info (untrusted metadata):\n```json\n{\n  \"message_id\": \"om_x100b5215072e48acc4d4cd575f2c466\",\n  \"sender_id\": \"ou_2ad19bb3863e71e2d0eff5cc4aeedd83\",\n  \"sender\": \"用户612847\",\n  \"timestamp\": \"Sun 2026-04-05 15:51 GMT+8\"\n}\n```\n\nSender (untrusted metadata):\n```json\n{\n  \"label\": \"用户612847 (ou_2ad19bb3863e71e2d0eff5cc4aeedd83)\",\n  \"id\": \"ou_2ad19bb3863e71e2d0eff5cc4aeedd83\",\n  \"name\": \"用户612847\"\n}\n```\n\n/Users/edy/.openclaw/media/inbound/51913d11-76e5-4cdc-a59e-6a35428486d2.jpg"}],"timestamp":1775375521338}}
{"type":"message","id":"5b002ff2","parentId":"91c72440","timestamp":"2026-04-05T07:52:07.297Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"The user sent an image. Let me analyze it.","thinkingSignature":"6a53dcfd674ea7270055ed7528d92f8b5924d852ecdb553148d13414d0e9511d"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_function_6t1057tj936n_1","name":"image","arguments":{"prompt":"描述这张图片的内容，如果是考试题目或试卷，请提取关键信息","image":"/Users/edy/.openclaw/media/inbound/51913d11-76e5-4cdc-a59e-6a35428486d2.jpg"}}],"api":"anthropic-messages","provider":"minimax","model":"MiniMax-M2.7","usage":{"input":130,"output":92,"cacheRead":39291,"cacheWrite":117378,"totalTokens":156891,"cost":{"input":0.000039,"output":0.0001104,"cacheRead":0.0023574599999999996,"cacheWrite":0.04401675,"total":0.04652361}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1775375521347,"responseId":"062147a1c15ccf3e9194401fb048358d"}}
{"type":"message","id":"6fbd7d5d","parentId":"5b002ff2","timestamp":"2026-04-05T07:52:19.109Z","message":{"role":"toolResult","toolCallId":"call_function_6t1057tj936n_1","toolName":"image","content":[{"type":"text","text":"这是一个包含地理练习题的文档页面。以下是该页面的关键信息提取：\n\n### **标题与基本信息**\n*   **标题：** 地理周末练习四\n*   **题型：** 二、非选择题（共50分）\n*   **第26题主题：** “青甘大环线”旅游线路。材料介绍了该线路连接了山川、湖泊、戈壁、草原等壮美景观和民俗风情。\n*   **附图：** \n    1.  青甘大环线路线图（标注了敦煌、德令哈、张掖、祁连山草原等地点）。\n    2.  德令哈光热发电站照片。\n    3.  敦煌光热发电站照片。\n    4.  张掖“稻画田园”照片。\n    5.  祁连山草原照片。\n\n### **核心题目及手写答案内容（提取）**\n1.  **关于地理位置与民居：**\n    *   **问题：** 青甘大环线的旅游起点位于青海省的哪个行政中心？当地特色民居以什么为主要建材？\n    *   **手写答案：** 起点是“西宁”；民居建材是“土坯”；主要发展的农业类型是“旱作”农业（此处字迹较模糊，可能为旱作或绿洲）。\n\n2.  **关于光热发电：**\n    *   **问题：** 位于柴达木盆地的德令哈和敦煌均建有光热发电站，分析其能源丰富的原因。\n    *   **手写答案：** “海拔高，空气稀薄，晴天多，日照时间长”。\n\n3.  **关于瓜果品质：**\n    *   **问题：** 瓜州被称为“蜜瓜之乡”，分析其瓜果品质优良的原因。\n    *   **手写答案：** ①“深居内陆，降水少，气候干旱，晴天多”；②“日照充足，有利于光合作用”；③“昼夜温差大，有利于有机物的积累”。\n\n4.  **关于农业：**\n    *   **问题：** 张掖市通过引用哪条河流的水灌溉来种植粮食作物？\n    *   **手写答案：** “黑河”。\n\n5.  **关于植被变化：**\n    *   **问题：** 从敦煌向东抵达祁连山草原，植被变化的规律及其影响因素。\n    *   **手写答案：** 植被由荒漠向草原变化是由“降水”因素导致的。\n\n6.  **关于生物对环境的适应：**\n    *   **问题：** 祁连山草原的牲畜皮毛厚实、血液含氧量高，说明这些特征与当地自然环境的关系。\n    *   **手写答案：** ①“当地海拔高度，厚实的皮毛起到保温、防寒的作用”；②“当地海拔高，空气稀薄，血红蛋白含量高，为了增加携带氧气量，是对低氧环境的适应”。\n\n### **其他标注信息**\n*   页面右下角有页码“192”。\n*   图例标注了等高线、铁路、城市和省界。"}],"details":{"model":"minimax/MiniMax-VL-01","image":"/Users/edy/.openclaw/media/inbound/51913d11-76e5-4cdc-a59e-6a35428486d2.jpg","attempts":[]},"isError":false,"timestamp":1775375539092}}
{"type":"message","id":"123dbda6","parentId":"6fbd7d5d","timestamp":"2026-04-05T07:52:33.838Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"This is a geography practice exam page about the \"Qing-Gan Grand Loop\" (青甘大环线) tourism route. It covers:\n\n1. Location of starting point (Xining) and local housing (土坯/土墙)\n2. Solar thermal power generation reasons (high altitude, thin air, many sunny days)\n3. Why melons are so sweet in Guazhou (dry climate, abundant sunlight, large temperature difference between day and night)\n4. Which river Zhangye uses for irrigation (Black River/黑河)\n5. Vegetation changes from Dunhuang to Qilian Mountains (influenced by precipitation)\n6. How animals adapt to the environment (thick fur for warmth, high hemoglobin for low oxygen)","thinkingSignature":"e796c973ed09eccbf67766382ad1df3cfe1ef673bb0f2c5bac1e56fcbb9b5cc3"},{"type":"text","text":"这是**地理周末练习四**的解答内容 📝\n\n**青甘大环线旅游线路 · 核心题目答案：**\n\n| # | 问题 | 答案 |\n|---|------|------|\n| 1 | 旅游起点+民居建材 | 西宁；土坯 |\n| 2 | 光热发电丰富原因 | 海拔高，空气稀薄，晴天多，日照时间长 |\n| 3 | 瓜州蜜瓜品质优良 | 降水少+日照足+昼夜温差大（利于糖分积累） |\n| 4 | 张掖引用哪条河灌溉 | 黑河 |\n| 5 | 敦煌→祁连山植被变化规律 | 由荒漠向草原变化，影响因素是**降水** |\n| 6 | 牦牛/牲畜对高原适应 | 厚毛保温；血红蛋白含量高适应低氧 |\n\n---\n\n**📌 高频考点归纳：**\n- 西北地区（青甘）→ 干旱气候 + 光照强 + 昼夜温差大\n- 柴达木盆地 = 高原盆地 + 光热资源丰富\n- 农业水源依赖河流（黑河）\n- 植被分异规律：**从沿海到内陆/从低到高，降水是主导因素**\n\n需要把这套题也追加到复习文件里吗？"}],"api":"anthropic-messages","provider":"minimax","model":"MiniMax-M2.7","usage":{"input":118241,"output":424,"cacheRead":39291,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":157956,"cost":{"input":0.0354723,"output":0.0005088,"cacheRead":0.0023574599999999996,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0.038338559999999994}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1775375539110,"responseId":"062147b330b36993bff58267ce1d0a87"}}
