{"type":"message","id":"773a45bb","parentId":"f4c19a71","timestamp":"2026-04-05T08:08:01.905Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"Updated successfully. Now the错因分析 correctly focuses on the main issue: London's \"多阴雨天\" characteristic wasn't highlighted.","thinkingSignature":"2f1640aac4bc4202152669a59e85ec2464c23b7284b1345907db43872e7d4226"},{"type":"text","text":"已更新 ✅\n\n**错因分析已修正为：**\n\n> 核心遗漏：伦敦\"多阴雨天\"这个关键特点没有点出来。温带海洋性气候的典型特征是全年温和湿润、阴雨天多，而地中海气候夏季高温少雨、晴天多——两者对比才是本题的踩分点。\n\n**💡 记住这个易错点：**\n- 温带海洋性气候 = 温和 + **湿润 + 多阴雨天**（伦敦代表城市）\n- 地中海气候 = 高温 + **少雨 + 晴天多**（罗马代表城市）\n\n这道题的核心踩分点就是**阴雨天 vs 晴天的对比**，下次一定要把这个关键词写进去 🌧️☀️"}],"api":"anthropic-messages","provider":"minimax","model":"MiniMax-M2.7","usage":{"input":127032,"output":178,"cacheRead":39291,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":166501,"cost":{"input":0.0381096,"output":0.0002136,"cacheRead":0.0023574599999999996,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0.04068066}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1775376474856,"responseId":"06214b5bbed18ec575235481b9585dfe"}}
{"type":"message","id":"09abd65f","parentId":"773a45bb","timestamp":"2026-04-05T08:11:14.376Z","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"type":"text","text":"[media attached: /Users/edy/.openclaw/media/inbound/02b46631-2f71-44f9-87e5-f04a89ea8e03.jpg (image/jpeg) | /Users/edy/.openclaw/media/inbound/02b46631-2f71-44f9-87e5-f04a89ea8e03.jpg]\nTo send an image back, prefer the message tool (media/path/filePath). If you must inline, use MEDIA:https://example.com/image.jpg (spaces ok, quote if needed) or a safe relative path like MEDIA:./image.jpg. Avoid absolute paths (MEDIA:/...) and ~ paths — they are blocked for security. Keep caption in the text body.\nSystem: [2026-04-05 16:11:12 GMT+8] Feishu[default] DM | 用户612847 (ou_2ad19bb3863e71e2d0eff5cc4aeedd83) [msg:om_x100b5215df3ae4a8c33f280b429101e, image, 1 attachment(s)]\n\nConversation info (untrusted metadata):\n```json\n{\n  \"message_id\": \"om_x100b5215df3ae4a8c33f280b429101e\",\n  \"sender_id\": \"ou_2ad19bb3863e71e2d0eff5cc4aeedd83\",\n  \"sender\": \"用户612847\",\n  \"timestamp\": \"Sun 2026-04-05 16:11 GMT+8\"\n}\n```\n\nSender (untrusted metadata):\n```json\n{\n  \"label\": \"用户612847 (ou_2ad19bb3863e71e2d0eff5cc4aeedd83)\",\n  \"id\": \"ou_2ad19bb3863e71e2d0eff5cc4aeedd83\",\n  \"name\": \"用户612847\"\n}\n```\n\n/Users/edy/.openclaw/media/inbound/02b46631-2f71-44f9-87e5-f04a89ea8e03.jpg"}],"timestamp":1775376674365}}
