{"type":"message","id":"918f4c27","parentId":"8ba60780","timestamp":"2026-04-05T09:17:54.265Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"Good, `openclaw skills update --all` exists. Let me check if there's a way to update OpenClaw itself. Let me also check the doctor command which might help.Let me set up a cron job that:\n1. Runs `openclaw skills update --all` to update skills\n2. Runs `npm update -g openclaw` to update OpenClaw (or check for updates)\n\nBut first, let me check if there's an openclaw update command.","thinkingSignature":"c9e6b9bb9d2eaf041c75d889c554e87c24acf78bd4288c7b1429ab1e6667d7da"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_function_juc89tmze9f8_1","name":"exec","arguments":{"command":"openclaw --version && npm show openclaw version 2>&1"}}],"api":"anthropic-messages","provider":"minimax","model":"MiniMax-M2.7","usage":{"input":34494,"output":136,"cacheRead":39291,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":73921,"cost":{"input":0.0103482,"output":0.00016319999999999998,"cacheRead":0.0023574599999999996,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0.01286886}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1775380669781,"responseId":"06215bbeccf366a4340339aa423f205c"}}
