{"type":"message","id":"2d53c6a0","parentId":"0e9e4a9b","timestamp":"2026-04-05T09:18:19.717Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"Good, OpenClaw is already at version 2026.4.2. Let me create a cron job that:1. Runs `openclaw skills update --all` to update all skills\n2. Reports what was updatedBut actually, since ClawHub is rate limited right now, let me just set up the cron job structure. The cron job will:1. Update all skills via `openclaw skills update --all`2. Check OpenClaw version and notify if update available\n\nLet me set up the cron job. Based on the skill page, it runs at 4 AM by default. Let me set it to run at a time that makes sense for频哥 - maybe early morning or after the daily sprout push at 21:30.Actually, since the skill page mentioned 4 AM but that might not be convenient for 频哥, let me ask or just set a reasonable time. Let me set it to 6 AM which is a typical time for daily checks.Actually, let me just set up the cron manually without the skill, since the skill keeps getting rate limited. I'll create a script that does what the auto-updater would do.","thinkingSignature":"4a8158571bd28cc6c902821a4ea3eefbe24f371e83d9bc356ee61b13038bbbeb"},{"type":"text","text":"ClawHub一直限速，我直接帮你搭一个等价的手动版本：\n"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_function_oxoblkfkhdr9_1","name":"write","arguments":{"path":"/Users/edy/.openclaw/workspace/scripts/openclaw-auto-update.sh","content":"#!/bin/bash\n# openclaw-auto-update.sh - OpenClaw自动更新脚本\n# 每天检查并更新OpenClaw和所有Skills\n# 建议时间：每天早上6点\n# cron: 0 6 * * * /Users/edy/.openclaw/workspace/scripts/openclaw-auto-update.sh\n\nWORKSPACE=\"$HOME/.openclaw/workspace\"\nLOG_FILE=\"$WORKSPACE/.backup.log\"\nDATE=$(date +%Y-%m-%d)\n\necho \"🔄 开始OpenClaw自动更新检查... $DATE\"\n\n# ===== 更新所有Skills =====\necho \"📦 检查Skills更新...\"\nSKILLS_RESULT=$(openclaw skills update --all 2>&1)\necho \"$SKILLS_RESULT\"\n\n# ===== 检查OpenClaw版本 =====\necho \"🔍 检查OpenClaw版本...\"\nCURRENT_VER=$(openclaw --version 2>&1 | head -1)\nLATEST_VER=$(npm show openclaw version 2>&1)\n\necho \"当前版本: $CURRENT_VER\"\necho \"最新版本: $LATEST_VER\"\n\n# ===== 发送飞书通知 =====\npython3 << 'PYEOF'\n# -*- coding: utf-8 -*-\nimport subprocess, json, os, datetime\n\nUSER_OPEN_ID = \"ou_2ad19bb3863e71e2d0eff5cc4aeedd83\"\n\ndef get_token():\n    CONFIG_FILE = os.path.expanduser(\"~/.openclaw/openclaw.json\")\n    with open(CONFIG_FILE) as f:\n        feishu_cfg = json.load(f).get(\"channels\", {}).get(\"feishu\", {})\n    APP_SECRET = feishu_cfg.get(\"appSecret\", \"\")\n    APP_ID = \"cli_a93534f5edb85bd3\"\n    \n    result = subprocess.run(\n        [\"curl\", \"-s\", \"-X\", \"POST\",\n         \"https://open.feishu.cn/open-apis/auth/v3/tenant_access_token/internal\",\n         \"-H\", \"Content-Type: application/json\",\n         \"-d\", json.dumps({\"app_id\": APP_ID, \"app_secret\": APP_SECRET})],\n        capture_output=True, text=True\n    )\n    data = json.loads(result.stdout)\n    return data.get(\"tenant_access_token\", \"\")\n\ndef send_message(token, content):\n    subprocess.run(\n        [\"curl\", \"-s\", \"-X\", \"POST\",\n         \"https://open.feishu.cn/open-apis/im/v1/messages?receive_id_type=open_id\",\n         \"-H\", f\"Authorization: Bearer {token}\",\n         \"-H\", \"Content-Type: application/json; charset=utf-8\",\n         \"-d\", json.dumps({\n             \"receive_id\": USER_OPEN_ID,\n             \"msg_type\": \"text\",\n             \"content\": json.dumps({\"text\": content}, ensure_ascii=False)\n         }, ensure_ascii=False)],\n        capture_output=True\n    )\n\ntoken = get_token()\nif not token:\n    print(\"获取 token 失败\")\n    exit(1)\n\nnow = datetime.datetime.now().strftime(\"%m月%d日 %H:%M\")\nskills_result = \"\"\"SKILLS_RESULT\"\"\"\ncurrent_ver = \"\"\"CURRENT_VER\"\"\"\nlatest_ver = \"\"\"LATEST_VER\"\"\"\n\n# 判断是否有更新\nif current_ver != latest_ver:\n    content = f\"\"\"🔄 OpenClaw 自动更新报告 | {now}\n\n**有可用更新！**\n- 当前版本: {current_ver}\n- 最新版本: {latest_ver}\n\n Skills已检查更新完成。\n\n---\n💡 来自 OpenClaw 自动更新\"\"\"\nelse:\n    content = f\"\"\"🔄 OpenClaw 自动更新报告 | {now}\n\n**已是最新版本** ✅\n- 当前版本: {current_ver}\n\n Skills已全部检查更新完毕，无新版本。\n\n---\n💡 来自 OpenClaw 自动更新\"\"\"\n\nsend_message(token, content)\nprint(\"✅ 更新报告已发送\")\nPYEOF\n\necho \"✅ 自动更新完成: $(date)\" | tee -a \"$LOG_FILE\"\n"}}],"api":"anthropic-messages","provider":"minimax","model":"MiniMax-M2.7","usage":{"input":34668,"output":1118,"cacheRead":39291,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":75077,"cost":{"input":0.010400399999999999,"output":0.0013415999999999999,"cacheRead":0.0023574599999999996,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0.014099459999999998}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1775380677724,"responseId":"06215bc62fd5291c30302bbecbba22e1"}}
