{"type":"message","id":"5d13ec5d","parentId":"379ee850","timestamp":"2026-04-05T09:20:57.825Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"The user is asking how I would handle the auto-updater situation best, given what we know (past OpenClaw auto-update broke the Feishu plugin).\n\nThe best approach here is actually to NOT auto-update OpenClaw, but still allow skills to auto-update. Let me think about the best recommendation:\n\n1. Skills auto-updates are relatively safe - they're just workspace files, shouldn't break the core system\n2. OpenClaw version auto-update is risky based on past experience\n\nSo the best recommendation is:\n- Skills auto-update: YES (safe)\n- OpenClaw version auto-update: NO (risky, past experience shows it broke Feishu plugin)\n\n\n- I could even search ClawHub for a skill that only handles skills updates without touching the OpenClaw version itself, rather than building something custom","thinkingSignature":"a6e3815a6bb7da640a6d43bfb2e2cb1817190c1301c8ae624ebcad4a5a9e9c20"},{"type":"text","text":"说实话，基于之前\"自动更新导致飞书插件故障\"的经验，**我建议这样处理**：\n\n**最安全的方案：**\n\n| 更新类型 | 建议 |\n|---------|------|\n| Skills自动更新 | ✅ 开启（风险低，只是workspace里的文件） |\n| OpenClaw版本自动更新 | ❌ 关闭（风险高，曾导致飞书插件失效） |\n\n**原因：**\n- Skills更新只是workspace里的文件，出问题最多那个skill不能用\n- OpenClaw版本更新影响核心功能，之前出过问题\n\n**做法：**\n我帮你改一下脚本，**只自动更新Skills，不动OpenClaw版本**。每天早上6点检查Skills更新，有更新就推送通知，没有就静默。这样既能保持skill最新，又不会半夜踩雷。\n\n要这样调整吗？"}],"api":"anthropic-messages","provider":"minimax","model":"MiniMax-M2.7","usage":{"input":0,"output":336,"cacheRead":74773,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":75109,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0.0004032,"cacheRead":0.00448638,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0.00488958}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1775380844214,"responseId":"06215c6c42fcc9617bfbc0d503b8f928"}}
