{"type":"message","id":"7a8b18f1","parentId":"30b65d17","timestamp":"2026-04-05T09:23:32.657Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"Again rate limited. Let me try with a different approach - maybe just explain what this skill does based on the search results and the web fetch I did. From the information:\n\n1. It integrates 17 search engines (8 CN + 9 Global)\n2. Supports advanced search operators\n3. Time filters\n4. Site search\n5. Privacy engines (DuckDuckGo, Startpage, Brave)\n6. WolframAlpha knowledge queries\n7. No API keys required\n\nThe assessment from the web fetch noted:\n- It's basically URL templates for search engines\n- Includes advanced operators that could find sensitive content (intext:password, cache:, inurl:login, filetype:txt) - potential for credential scraping\n- No binaries or API keys needed\n- Low installation risk\n\nLet me tell the user what I found and suggest whether to install it.","thinkingSignature":"3871a90d3880e1deceb28ffd6a73ccce132718993648c448ad0d3f1fd8a200b9"},{"type":"text","text":"ClawHub限速，装不了。不过根据研究结果，汇报一下：\n\n**Multi Search Engine 2 技能说明：**\n\n| 功能 | 内容 |\n|------|------|\n| 搜索引擎 | 17个（8个国内 + 9个全球） |\n| 支持 | 高级搜索指令、时间筛选、站点搜索、隐私搜索、WolframAlpha |\n| 所需API | 无（纯URL模板） |\n| 安装风险 | 低（纯指令文件，不下载二进制） |\n\n**国内引擎**：百度、搜狗、必应等\n**全球引擎**：Google、DuckDuckGo、Brave、Startpage等\n\n**⚠️ 注意一点：**\n评估报告提到它包含`intext:password`、`filetype:txt`这类操作符，理论上可以搜索敏感信息——但工具本身不偷数据，只是给你模板。\n\n**适合场景：**\n- 需要同时搜多个搜索引擎对比结果\n- 想用隐私引擎DuckDuckGo/Brave（不被追踪）\n- 做研究时需要 WolframAlpha 知识查询\n\n**建议**：可以装，但不急——我已经有`web_search`内置工具可以搜索，这个是增强版。要装吗？"}],"api":"anthropic-messages","provider":"minimax","model":"MiniMax-M2.7","usage":{"input":40264,"output":416,"cacheRead":39291,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":79971,"cost":{"input":0.0120792,"output":0.0004992,"cacheRead":0.0023574599999999996,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0.014935859999999999}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1775380998783,"responseId":"06215d07b72a9e2317a31b7f619d00a7"}}
