{"type":"message","id":"8ed56437","parentId":"531db1eb","timestamp":"2026-04-05T10:10:51.060Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"DuckDuckGo also fails. The issue is that many of these engines are blocked in China. Let me try a more comprehensive test to see which engines work and which don't, and summarize for the user.","thinkingSignature":"09a6e6120187cedeacf1eea72dcb83a9fb5f40726dd35476ad8b1f13cc5cb34d"},{"type":"text","text":"测试结果汇报：\n\n**✅ 可用引擎（国内）：**\n- **搜狗**：搜索中文内容有效，找到\"生物地理会考知识点与真题\"相关内容\n- **Bing国际版**：可用，但搜中文关键词时结果偏乱（被百度产物索引干扰）\n\n**❌ 被墙/失效：**\n- Google → 网络问题\n- DuckDuckGo → fetch failed\n- 百度 → 安全验证拦截\n- WolframAlpha → JS渲染需要浏览器\n\n**💡 实际用法建议：**\n\n| 场景 | 推荐引擎 |\n|------|---------|\n| 搜中文最新资讯 | 搜狗 |\n| 技术文档/GitHub | Bing国际版 |\n| 微信文章 | `https://wx.sogou.com/weixin?type=2&query=关键词` |\n| 今日头条 | 头条搜索 |\n\n**⚠️ 注意：**\n国内环境下，多搜索引擎不如直接用`web_search`（内置Tavily）效果好，那个是专门给AI搜索设计的。\n\n**结论**：multi-search-engine在**国内可用的只有搜狗和Bing**，其他大部分被墙。这个skill更适合海外用户。你觉得还有必要留着吗？"}],"api":"anthropic-messages","provider":"minimax","model":"MiniMax-M2.7","usage":{"input":49829,"output":286,"cacheRead":39291,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":89406,"cost":{"input":0.014948699999999999,"output":0.0003432,"cacheRead":0.0023574599999999996,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0.01764936}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1775383841200,"responseId":"06216821f24f9ec13ef86b55c572a835"}}
